  "description": "INCLUDED:\n– 12 Seamless Digital Papers\n– Size: 12″ x 12″,  3600 x 3600 pixels\n– Format: Jpeg\n– Resolution: 300 dpi\nYour designs just got a tropical glow-up! The Tropic Pop set of seamless patterns bursts with vibrant energy, blending electric purples, hot pinks, sunset oranges, and rainforest teals into juicy, seamless jungle leaf patterns. It’s like your favorite summer playlist turned visual, and every pattern is vibing at full volume.\nThese 12 seamless digital papers are perfect for jazzing up your next creative adventure. Print them on fabric for bold fashion statements, layer them into unforgettable scrapbook layouts, or use them in sublimation projects that scream “vacation mode ON.” Whether you’re designing planners, party invites, or branding with flair, Tropic Pop is your go-to for summer color-soaked fun.",
